# Bangumi Catcher agent rules

The canonical guide is [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Read it before editing.

Non-negotiables:

- Tests are offline; use `tests/fakes.py` and `tests/factories.py`.
- Keep the dependency direction enforced by `tests/architecture/test_layers.py`.
- Never import Matplotlib at module scope in `src/bangumi_catcher/ui/`.
- Exports go through `reporting.atomic_output` (no partial files).
- Remote collections are read-only.
- Definition of done: `python scripts/dev.py check`.
